<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <%- include('layout-partials/head', { title: 'Pricing' }) %>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="page-bg">
    <div class="page-bg__blob page-bg__blob--1"></div>
    <div class="page-bg__blob page-bg__blob--2"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="container">
    <%- include('layout-partials/nav') %>

    <section class="section" style="text-align: center;">
      <div class="page-stickers" aria-hidden="true">
        <span class="page-sticker page-sticker--1">🎁</span>
        <span class="page-sticker page-sticker--2">💸</span>
      </div>
      <p class="eyebrow">Pricing</p>
      <h1>Cheap on purpose. It's a gesture, not a purchase.</h1>
      <p style="max-width: 480px; margin: 10px auto 0;">Less than a coffee. Nothing is charged until you actually check out, and every link stays live for a full month.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="section-tight">
      <div class="tiers" data-reveal>
        <div class="tier">
          <h3>Bank Game</h3>
          <div class="tier__price"><%= bankGameRange.display %></div>
          <p>Pick a ready-made minigame and ask your question in minutes.</p>
          <ul class="tier__features">
            <li>Instant, ready to share</li>
            <li>Live for 1 month</li>
            <li>Email the moment they answer</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="/games" class="btn btn-secondary" style="width: 100%;">Browse games</a>
        </div>
        <div class="tier tier--highlighted">
          <span class="tier__badge">Most personal</span>
          <h3>Custom Game</h3>
          <div class="tier__price"><%= customTier.priceDisplay %></div>
          <p>Tell us what you want the game to be and what it's for. We build it around your idea.</p>
          <ul class="tier__features">
            <li>Everything in Bank Game</li>
            <li>Built around your idea</li>
            <li>Renewable monthly for a small fee</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="/custom-request/<%= customTier.id %>" class="btn btn-primary" style="width: 100%;">Request a custom game</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section-tight" style="text-align: center;" data-reveal>
      <p style="color: var(--color-ink-faint); font-size: 14px;">Not sure yet? <a href="/demo" style="color: var(--color-accent); font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none;">Try a demo first</a> — see exactly what they'll play before you pay for anything.</p>
    </section>

    <%- include('layout-partials/footer') %>
  </div>

  <script src="/js/reveal.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
